            <ArticleTitle>[Cancer of the kidney manifested by stercoral peritonitis].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>356-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors report a case of hypernephroma revealed by an acute surgical abdomen. The laparotomy found a stercoral peritonitis. A review of the literature shows that this observation is exceptional.</AbstractText>
